[00:00:27.134] Server  LOG     Heloooooooooooooooooo Pinecone Response: "{\n  \"result\": {\n    \"hits\": [\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"482\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4222739040851593,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"FORM NO.12BB                     \\t\\n                                                                           (See rule 26C)\\n \\n*For claiming deduction under 80D(Medical Insurance), a copy of Insurance certificate containing the name of the insured persons may be enclosed.\\n  \\n \\n \\n \\n\\nNEW HIRE ORIENTATION – WELCOME HANDBOOK\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"833\",\n        \"_score\": 0.35728389024734497,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Step 1: Submit Form 12BB\\nThis is your Investment Declaration. Most companies require this by Jan/Feb to calculate your final TDS (Tax Deducted at Source) for the year.\\nAction: Log in to your HR portal and update your \\\"Actual\\\" investments for the year.\\nStep 2: Choose Your Regime\\nBudget 2025 has significantly enhanced the New Regime, making it the better choice for most people earning up to ₹15–20 Lakhs unless they have very high rent/home loans.\\nNew Tax Regime (Default):\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"930\",\n        \"_score\": 0.27179014682769775,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"BENEFICIARY DECLARATION FORM\\nEmployee Details\\nEmployee Name: ___________________________\\nEmployee ID: ___________________________\\nDesignation: ___________________________\\nDepartment: ___________________________\\nBeneficiary Details\\nI hereby declare the following person(s) as beneficiary/beneficiaries for receiving applicable benefits as per company policy and statutory requirements.\\n(Total percentage should equal 100%)\\nDeclaration\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"457\",\n        \"_score\": 0.2577209174633026,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"NOMINATION AND DECLARATION FORM FOR UNEXEMPTED/ EXEMPTED ESTABLISHMENTS\\nDeclaration and Nomination Form under the Employees’ Provident Funds and Employees’ Pension Scheme\\n \\n(Paragraphs 33 & 61 (1) of the Employees Provident Fund Scheme, 1952 and Paragraph 18 of the Employees’ Pension scheme, 1995)\\n1.      Name (in Block letters)        \\t:\\n \\n2.      Father’s/Husband’s Name    \\t:\\n3.      Date of Birth                        \\t:\\n \\n4.      Sex                                      \\t:\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"522\",\n        \"_score\": 0.2576392889022827,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"5. Submission & Compliance\\nDeclaration Window: All FBP elections must be made at the start of the FY or within 15 days of joining.\\nProof Submission: Original bills/documents (Rent receipts, Boarding passes, Driver receipts) must be uploaded to the Employee Declaration Portal by the 15th of the month.\\nBill Deadlines: Monthly bills (Fuel, Broadband) by the 20th; Annual bills (LTA, Books) by Feb 28th.\\nLTA Deadline: Claims must be submitted within 90 days of the travel date.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"467\",\n        \"_score\": 0.25757649540901184,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"GUIDANCE FOR FILLING THE FORM No - 2\\n \\nEmployee’s Provident Fund Scheme, 1952:-\\n( E P F )\\nPara 33 :-  Declaration by persons already employed at the time of institution of the fund :-\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"582\",\n        \"_score\": 0.2537700831890106,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Notification: As per the 2026 mandate, ABIS will notify the Data Protection Board (DPB) of any significant breach within 72 hours of discovery.\\n\\nWITNESS STATEMENT FORM\\n \\n \\n\\n Attach additional sheets as needed.  As a witness, your signature below indicates that the information you've provided on this form is truthful.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"462\",\n        \"_score\": 0.2469681352376938,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"*Strike out whichever is not applicable.\\n\\nPart B (EPS) (Para 18)\\nI hereby furnish below particulars of the members of my family who would be eligible to receive widow/children pension in the event of my death.\\n \\n1\\n \\n2\\n3\\n \\n4\\n \\n5\\n6\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"464\",\n        \"_score\": 0.24010786414146423,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Name and Address of the Nominee                                                                                           \\tDate of Birth                                                                              \\tRelationship with the member\\n\\n 1                                                                \\t2                                                                \\t3\\n1.\\n \\n2.\\n3.\\n \\n4.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"663\",\n        \"_score\": 0.23716896772384644,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"I also hereby declare that the particulars above have been given by me and are true to the best of my knowledge and belief. I also undertake to intimate to the Corporation any changes in the membership of my family within 15 days of such changes having occurred.\\n \\n\\n \\nDate ......................\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"662\",\n        \"_score\": 0.22239872813224792,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"FORM 1A\\nFAMILY DECLARATION FORM\\n(Regulation 15A)\\nName of the insured person ...............................................................................................\\nInsurance Number ...................................................................................................................\\n \\nI hereby declare that my parents’ monthly income (from all the sources) does not exceed Rs 9000/-\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"178\",\n        \"_score\": 0.22059032320976257,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"FULL & FINAL SETTLEMENT POLICY\\nCOMPANY NAME: (COMPANY NAME)\\nREGISTERED OFFICE: (ADDRESS)\\n1. SCOPE\\nThis policy defines the timelines, inclusions, exclusions, and governance for processing Full & Final (F&F) settlement for employees exiting (COMPANY NAME).\\nThis policy applies to: \\n- All permanent employees\\n - All grades, bands, and functions \\n- Corporate, plant, and site-based roles\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"468\",\n        \"_score\": 0.21927909553050995,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Every person who is required or entitled to become a member of the Fund shall be asked forthwith by his employer to furnish and shall, on such demand, furnish to him, for communication to the Commissioner, particulars concerning himself and his nominee required for the declaration form in Form 2. Such employer shall enter the particulars in the declaration form and obtain the signature or thumb impression of the person concerned.\\n \\nPara 61 : Nomination\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"507\",\n        \"_score\": 0.21198363602161407,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"REGISTERED OFFICE: (ADDRESS)\\nREVIEW FREQUENCY: Annual or upon policy change\\nAPPROVAL AUTHORITY: Head – HR\\n6. ANNEXURE TEMPLATE\\nCOMPANY NAME: (COMPANY NAME)\\nREGISTERED OFFICE: (ADDRESS)\\nEMPLOYEE DETAILS\\nCandidate Name: _______________________________\\nEmployee ID (Post-Joining): ___________________\\nDesignation: _________________________________\\nDepartment / Function: ________________________\\nGrade / Band: _________________________________\\nLocation: ____________________________________\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"182\",\n        \"_score\": 0.20027877390384674,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Unapproved incentive claims\\nDiscretionary bonuses not yet declared\\nFuture or contingent benefits\\nClaims pending investigation or dispute\\n\\n7. TAXATION AND STATUTORY COMPLIANCE\\nApplicable taxes shall be deducted as per law\\nStatutory forms and disclosures will be issued as required\\nEmployees are responsible for personal tax compliance beyond employer obligations\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"670\",\n        \"_score\": 0.1987629383802414,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"REIMBURSEMENT CLAIM FORM\\nEmployee Details\\nEmployee Name: ___________________________\\nEmployee ID: ___________________________\\nDesignation: ___________________________\\nDepartment: ___________________________\\nClaim Details\\nType of Reimbursement: (Travel / Meal / Medical / Internet / Other)\\nClaim Period: From ____ / ____ / ______ To ____ / ____ / ______\\nPurpose of Expense:\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"260\",\n        \"_score\": 0.19876253604888916,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Gratuity Payment Approval Form (Form 'L')\\nNOTICE FOR PAYMENT OF GRATUITY\\n(Form L – As per Rule 8 of Payment of Gratuity Rules, 1972)\\nTo,\\n[Employee/Legal Heir Name]\\n[Address]\\nYou are hereby informed that a gratuity amount of ₹[Amount] is payable to you for your service at ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. under the Payment of Gratuity Act, 1972.\\nKindly collect the amount via [Cheque/Cash] on [Date] from [Location]. Alternatively, it will be sent to your address by registered post.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"665\",\n        \"_score\": 0.19792741537094116,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Name, Address and code no. of employer ...........................................................................................\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"928\",\n        \"_score\": 0.1978297084569931,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"NOMINATION FORM\\nEmployee Details\\nEmployee Name: ___________________________\\nEmployee ID: ___________________________\\nDesignation: ___________________________\\nDepartment: ___________________________\\nDate of Joining: ____ / ____ / ______\\nNomination Details\\nI hereby nominate the person(s) mentioned below to receive all benefits payable by the organization in the event of my death, as per applicable laws and company policies.\\n(Total percentage should equal 100%)\\nNominee Address\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"259\",\n        \"_score\": 0.19708794355392456,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"2. Address: [Your Address]\\n3. Department: [Your Department]\\n4. Date of Joining: [DD/MM/YYYY]\\n5. Reason for Separation: [Resignation/Retirement/Disablement]\\n6. Total Service Duration: [Years Completed]\\n7. Last Drawn Wages: ₹[Amount]\\n8. Gratuity Amount Claimed: ₹[Amount]\\n9. Supporting Documents: [If applicable]\\n10. Preferred Mode of Payment: Cash/Cheque/Bank Transfer\\nSincerely,\\n[Signature]\\n[Date]\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"631\",\n        \"_score\": 0.18930888175964355,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"LEAVER – RELIEVING & EXPERIENCE LETTER TEMPLATES\\nCOMPANY NAME: (COMPANY NAME)\\nREGISTERED OFFICE: (ADDRESS)\\n1. PURPOSE AND USAGE\\nThese standard templates are to be used for issuing Relieving Letters and Experience Letters to employees exiting (COMPANY NAME), subject to completion of all exit formalities and full & final settlement.\\n2. RELIEVING LETTER – STANDARD TEMPLATE\\nDate: ____________\\nTo Whomsoever It May Concern,\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"835\",\n        \"_score\": 0.18745292723178864,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"80C (Max ₹1.5L): PPF, ELSS, EPF (usually captured by HR), LIC, School tuition fees.\\n80D: Health insurance premium receipts (Self and Parents).\\nSection 24: Home loan interest certificate from your bank.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"929\",\n        \"_score\": 0.18700693547725677,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Declaration\\nI hereby declare that the information provided above is true and correct to the best of my knowledge. I understand that this nomination supersedes any previous nomination made by me.\\nEmployee Signature: ___________________________\\nDate: ___________________________\\nWitness Details\\nWitness Name: ___________________________\\nSignature: ___________________________\\nDate: ___________________________\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"321\",\n        \"_score\": 0.18523722887039185,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Deduct income tax based on the applicable tax slabs and employee declarations.\\nIssue Form 16 to employees and file TDS returns with the Income Tax Department.\\n5.4 Professional Tax:\\nDetermine the applicable professional tax rates as per state regulations.\\nDeduct professional tax from employees' salaries and remit it to the respective state authorities.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"479\",\n        \"_score\": 0.18497750163078308,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Para 18 : Particulars to be supplied by the Employees already employed at the time of commencement of the Employees Pension Scheme.\\nEvery person who is entitled to become a member of the Employees Pension Fund shall be asked forthwith by his employer to furnish and that person shall, on such demand, furnish to him for communication to the Commissioner particulars concerning himself and his family in the form prescribed by the Central Provident Fund Commissioner.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"458\",\n        \"_score\": 0.18423280119895935,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"5.      Marital Status                      \\t:\\n \\n6.      Account No.                         \\t:\\n \\n7.      Address                                         \\tPermanent \\t:\\n \\nTemporary \\t:\\n8.      Date of joining                     \\t:\\n \\n \\n \\n \\nPART – A (EPF)\\nI hereby nominate the person(s) /cancel the nomination made by me previously and nominate the person(s) mentioned below to receive the amount standing to my credit in the Employees’ Provident Fund in the event of my death :\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"915\",\n        \"_score\": 0.18155553936958313,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"CONFIDENTIAL – Submitted directly to HR\\n\\nSECTION 1: EMPLOYEE INFORMATION\\n\\n Full Name: ____________________    Employee ID: ______________\\n Department: ____________________    Manager: __________________\\n Current Desk: ____________________    Floor: __________________\\n Date of Request: ____________________\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"788\",\n        \"_score\": 0.18052265048027039,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Very important\\nSomewhat important\\nNot very important\\nNot at all important\\n16. How do you manage your work-life balance? (Select all that apply)\\nThe answer should be a multiple choice:\\nTime management\\nSetting boundaries\\nDelegating tasks\\nPrioritising responsibilities\\nDATA PRIVACY & CONFIDENTIALITY (NDA) ACKNOWLEDGEMENT FORM\\n1. Purpose\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"258\",\n        \"_score\": 0.1803879290819168,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Gratuity Request Form (Template)\\nTo,\\n[Employer’s Name]\\nABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.\\n[Location]\\nSubject: Application for Payment of Gratuity\\nDear Sir/Madam,\\nI am writing to request the release of my gratuity payment under Section 4(1) of the Payment of Gratuity Act, 1972. I have completed [X] years of service and was separated from service on [Last Working Date] due to [Reason – resignation/retirement/disablement].\\nPlease find the required details below:\\n1. Full Name: [Your Name]\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"520\",\n        \"_score\": 0.1802092343568802,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Books & Periodicals: Fully exempt on submission of bills. Targeted at professional journals, technical books, and skill-based subscriptions (e.g., LinkedIn Learning, Harvard Business Review).\\n3.2 Vehicle & Chauffeur Policy (Bands SM1 – TM2)\\nSenior leaders are eligible for the Company Leased Car (CLC) model:\\nLease Rental: Paid directly by the company, reducing the employee's taxable \\\"Gross Salary.\\\"\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"692\",\n        \"_score\": 0.17891325056552887,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"16. Effective Date\\nThis Company Asset Usage Policy is effective from the date of approval and supersedes any previous asset usage guidelines.\\n\\nCustomer Complaint Registration Form\\nABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. – Customer Complaint Form\\nTicket ID: [Auto-generated]\\n\\n 1. Customer Details\\nName: ___________________________\\nPhone: __________________________\\nEmail: __________________________\\nAccount / Contract ID: _____________\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"221\",\n        \"_score\": 0.17866741120815277,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"11. Confidentiality\\nDepartment and cost center information is classified as internal organizational data and must be used only for official purposes.\\n\\n12. Exceptions\\nAny exception to standard department or cost center structure must be approved by HR Head and Finance Head.\\n\\n13. Review & Amendments\\nThis Department Master may be reviewed periodically to reflect organizational changes, restructuring, or business expansion.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"37\",\n        \"_score\": 0.17582237720489502,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"12. Effective Date\\nThis document is effective from the date of issue and supersedes any previous guidelines related to employment type classification.\\n\\nEmployee Commitment Survey Template\\n\\nDear Employee,\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"645\",\n        \"_score\": 0.174575537443161,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"12. Review & Amendments\\nThis guide may be reviewed and updated periodically based on statutory changes or organizational requirements.\\n\\n13. Effective Date\\nThis guide is effective from the date of issue and supersedes any previous communication related to salary structure explanation.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"463\",\n        \"_score\": 0.17425736784934998,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"** Certified that I have no family, as defined in para 2(vii) of Employees’ Pension Scheme, 1995 and should I acquire a family hereafter I shall furnish particulars thereon in the above form.\\n \\nI hereby nominate the following person for receiving the monthly widow pension (admissible under para 16 2(a)(i) and (ii) in the event of my death without leaving any eligible family member for receiving Pension.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"469\",\n        \"_score\": 0.1734255701303482,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"1.   \\tEach member shall make in his declaration in Form 2, a nomination conferring the right to receive the amount that may stand to his credit in the Fund in the event of his death before the amount standing to his credit has become payable, or where the amount has become payable before payment has been made.\\n2.   \\tA member may in this nomination distribute the amount that may stand to his credit in the Fund amongst his nominees at his own discretion.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"461\",\n        \"_score\": 0.17264637351036072,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"1         * Certified that I have no family as defined in para 2(g) of the Employees’ Provident Fund Scheme, 1952 and should I acquire a Family hereafter, the above nomination should be deemed as cancelled.\\n2         * Certified that my father/mother is/are dependent upon me.\\n \\n \\nSignature or thumb impression of the subscriber\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"671\",\n        \"_score\": 0.17261762917041779,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Expense Details\\nDeclaration\\nI hereby declare that the above expenses were incurred by me for official purposes and have not been claimed earlier.\\nEmployee Signature: ___________________________\\nDate: ___________________________\\nApproval\\nReporting Manager Approval: ___________________________\\nDate: ___________________________\\nFinance / HR Approval: ___________________________\\nDate: ___________________________\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"643\",\n        \"_score\": 0.1660582721233368,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"7. Deductions\\nThe following deductions may apply:\\nEmployee PF contribution\\nProfessional tax (if applicable)\\nIncome tax as per statutory requirements\\nOther authorized deductions\\n\\n8. Taxation\\nIncome tax is deducted at source (TDS) as per applicable laws\\nEmployees may submit tax declarations and proofs within specified timelines\\nTax benefits and exemptions are governed by statutory regulations\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"518\",\n        \"_score\": 0.1656130850315094,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Flexible Benefits Policy\\n\\n1. Objective & Overview\\nThe Flexible Benefit Plan (FBP) empowers employees to restructure their CTC to maximize take-home pay through tax-efficient components.\\nOpt-in: Employees select components at the start of the Financial Year.\\nFlexi-Pay (Taxable): Any unallocated FBP amount is paid monthly as \\\"Special Allowance\\\" or \\\"Flexi-Pay\\\" and is fully taxable.\\n\\n2. Allocation Table by Grade\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"readUnits\": 1,\n    \"embedTotalTokens\": 7\n  }\n}"
