[00:01:28.361] Server  LOG     Heloooooooooooooooooo Pinecone Response: "{\n  \"result\": {\n    \"hits\": [\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"295\",\n        \"_score\": 0.5615796446800232,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Employee Opinion Survey Template\\n\\nDear Employee,\\n\\nWe value your feedback and would like to take a few moments of your time to complete this survey. Your answers will be confidential and will help us understand your thoughts and opinions about our company and work environment. Thank you for your participation.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"922\",\n        \"_score\": 0.5309949517250061,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Job Satisfaction Survey Template\\n\\nDear Employee,\\n\\nWe are committed to ensuring that our employees are satisfied with their jobs and the work environment at ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. In order to better understand and address any potential areas for improvement, we would greatly appreciate if you could take a few minutes to complete the following survey.\\n\\nYour feedback is completely anonymous and will be used to inform our ongoing efforts to support and enhance the employee experience.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"497\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4742116630077362,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Closing Note\\nWe are excited to have you as part of our organization.\\nWelcome to [Company Name] — we wish you success and growth ahead.\\n\\nFeedback Response Worksheet\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"967\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4592971205711365,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"What could the organization have done differently to retain you?\\n__________________________________________________\\nSection D – Reason for Exit\\n7. Primary reason for leaving (select all that apply):\\n Career growth  Compensation  Role mismatch  Work-life balance  Personal reasons  Management  Other: __________\\nSection E – Open Feedback\\n8. Any suggestions or feedback you would like to share?\\n__________________________________________________\\n9. REPORTING AND REVIEW\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"965\",\n        \"_score\": 0.45849335193634033,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Individual identifiers to be removed in analytics and reporting\\nData usage strictly for organizational improvement\\n8. EXIT INTERVIEW FORM – STANDARD FORMAT\\nEmployee Details\\nEmployee Name (Optional): __________________________\\nEmployee ID: __________________________\\nDepartment / Function: __________________________\\nDesignation: __________________________\\nLast Working Day: __________________________\\nSection A – Overall Experience\\n1. How would you rate your overall experience with the organization?\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"297\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4520021378993988,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Neither agree nor disagree\\nDisagree\\nStrongly disagree\\n4. How satisfied are you with your immediate co-workers and team?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n5. How would you rate the communication between management and employees?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nExcellent\\nGood\\nAverage\\nPoor\\nVery Poor\\n6. Do you feel that management is approachable and willing to listen to your concerns?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"57\",\n        \"_score\": 0.45085716247558594,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Giving feedback to an employee \\n\\n\\nGiving feedback to a superior \\nGiving feedback to a coworker\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"499\",\n        \"_score\": 0.44867753982543945,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Receiving feedback from an employee \\n\\n\\nReceiving feedback from a coworker\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"524\",\n        \"_score\": 0.44538018107414246,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Dear Employee,\\n\\nWe prioritise the physical and mental well-being of our employees and are committed to creating a supportive and healthy work environment. In order to better understand and address any potential areas for improvement, we would greatly appreciate if you could take a few minutes to complete the following survey.\\n\\nYour feedback is completely anonymous and will be used to inform our ongoing efforts to support and enhance employee wellness.\\n\\nThank you for your participation!\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"910\",\n        \"_score\": 0.44442829489707947,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Dear Employee,\\n\\nWe are always striving to improve our team building activities and events, and your feedback is incredibly important to us. We would greatly appreciate it if you could take a few moments to complete this survey so that we can gain a better understanding of what you thought of our recent team building event. Your answers will be kept confidential and anonymous, and will be used solely for the purpose of improving our future events.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"42\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4444010555744171,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"The answer should be a single choice:\\nYes\\nNo\\nSometimes\\n12. Do you feel that your manager provides a clear career path for you?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nYes\\nNo\\nSomewhat\\n13. Do you have any comments that you would like to add?\\nThe answer should be a multi line text input.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"955\",\n        \"_score\": 0.44282591342926025,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"8. It was easy to reach a representative from our company if I had questions or concerns\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nStrongly agree\\nAgree\\nNeutral\\nDisagree\\nStrongly disagree\\n9. What could have been improved about the recruitment process?\\nThe answer should be a multi line text input.\\n10. Would you recommend us as a good place to work to others?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nYes\\nNo\\n\\n\\nNEW HIRE DESK ONBOARDING CHECKLIST\\n\\n\\n[COMPANY LETTERHEAD]\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"909\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4407801032066345,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"11. POLICY OWNERSHIP AND REVIEW\\nDOCUMENT OWNER: HR Operations – (COMPANY NAME)\\nREGISTERED OFFICE: (ADDRESS)\\nREVIEW FREQUENCY: Annual or upon organizational change\\nAPPROVAL AUTHORITY: Head – HR / Leadership Team\\n\\nEmployee Motivation Message Template\\nIndividual employee motivation message\\n\\nTeam motivation message\\n\\n\\nTeam Building Feedback Survey Template\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"144\",\n        \"_score\": 0.43557319045066833,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"EMPLOYEE GRIEVANCE FORM\\n \\n \\n \\n\\n Please retain a copy of this form for your own records.  As the grievant, please provide your signature below, as it indicates that the information you've included on this form is truthful.\\n \\n\\n\\nCompany Policy Update Template\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"38\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4328191578388214,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"As we strive to build a workplace that values commitment, teamwork and motivation, we would like to ask for your participation in this Employee Commitment Survey. The information gathered from this survey will help us understand the current level of employee commitment and the areas that require improvement.\\n\\nYour response is confidential and will only be used for internal purposes. Your honest and candid feedback will be appreciated.\\n\\nThank you for taking the time to complete this survey.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"241\",\n        \"_score\": 0.43173667788505554,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Employee Pulse Survey\\n\\nDear Employee,\\n\\nWe are committed to creating a workplace where every employee feels valued and supported. To help us understand and improve the employee experience, we invite you to take a few minutes to complete this employee pulse survey.\\n\\nYour feedback is important to us and will be used to inform decisions about the workplace and company culture. Please answer each question as honestly as possible. Your answers will be kept confidential and anonymous.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"507\",\n        \"_score\": 0.42879050970077515,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"REGISTERED OFFICE: (ADDRESS)\\nREVIEW FREQUENCY: Annual or upon policy change\\nAPPROVAL AUTHORITY: Head – HR\\n6. ANNEXURE TEMPLATE\\nCOMPANY NAME: (COMPANY NAME)\\nREGISTERED OFFICE: (ADDRESS)\\nEMPLOYEE DETAILS\\nCandidate Name: _______________________________\\nEmployee ID (Post-Joining): ___________________\\nDesignation: _________________________________\\nDepartment / Function: ________________________\\nGrade / Band: _________________________________\\nLocation: ____________________________________\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"913\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4254245162010193,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Strongly Disagree\\n8. Was the timing of the event convenient for all attendees?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nStrongly Agree\\nAgree\\nNeutral\\nDisagree\\nStrongly Disagree\\n9. Was the event well-organised and well-run?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nStrongly Agree\\nAgree\\nNeutral\\nDisagree\\nStrongly Disagree\\n10. What could have been improved about the event?\\nThe answer should be a multi line text input.\\n11. Do you have any suggestions for future team building events?\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"384\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4217967987060547,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Diversity And Inclusion Survey\\n\\nDear Employee,\\n\\nThank you for taking the time to complete this survey. Your input is important in helping us better understand the diversity and inclusion needs of our workplace. This survey is completely anonymous and confidential. Your responses will be used to guide our efforts to create a more inclusive workplace for everyone.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"966\",\n        \"_score\": 0.40983113646507263,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Excellent  Good  Average  Poor\\nWhat did you like most about working here?\\n__________________________________________________\\nSection B – Role and Manager\\n3. Were your roles and responsibilities clearly defined?\\n Yes  No  Partially\\nHow would you describe the support from your reporting manager?\\n Excellent  Good  Average  Poor\\nSection C – Growth and Development\\n5. Did you feel you had adequate growth and learning opportunities?\\n Yes  No\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"919\",\n        \"_score\": 0.40597301721572876,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"SECTION 7: CONFIDENTIALITY & DISCLOSURE\\nHR only \\nManager \\nFacilities \\nOccupational health\\nDisclosure preference: _____________________________________________________\\n\\n \\nSECTION 8: EXPECTED OUTCOMES\\n\\n ______________________________________________________________\\n ______________________________________________________________\\n\\n\\nSECTION 9: AGREEMENT & CONSENT\\nI agree to assessment and follow-up\\n\\nEmployee Signature: ____________________    Date: ___________\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"879\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4032474160194397,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"New Employee Orientation Survey Template\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"41\",\n        \"_score\": 0.403160035610199,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"8. Do you feel that your team is well managed?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nYes\\nNo\\nSomewhat\\n9. Do you feel that your current role allows for personal and professional growth?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nYes\\nNo\\nSomewhat\\n10. Do you feel that your manager provides opportunities for skill development and training?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nYes\\nNo\\nSometimes\\n11. Do you feel that you receive regular feedback and coaching from your manager?\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"693\",\n        \"_score\": 0.39981135725975037,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"2. Complaint Details\\nDate / Time Received: ______________\\nChannel (Email / Phone / Social): ____\\nService / Product Reference: _______\\nPriority: \\n Low   \\nMedium   \\nHigh   \\nCritical\\n\\n 3. Issue Description\\n____________________________________________________________\\n____________________________________________________________\\n____________________________________________________________\\nPriority Reason: __________________\\n\\n 4. Supporting Documents: \\nAttached\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"150\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3995746970176697,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"The answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery frustrated\\n9. How much do you feel the company values and includes employee input and feedback?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nA lot\\nSomewhat\\nNeutral\\nNot very much\\nNot at all\\n10. How much do you feel ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. promotes a healthy work-life balance for its employees?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nA lot\\nSomewhat\\nNeutral\\nNot very much\\nNot at all\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"633\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3974236249923706,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"We thank Mr./Ms. [Employee Name] for their contributions and wish them success in their future endeavors.\\nFor (COMPANY NAME)\\nAuthorized Signatory\\nName: ____________\\nDesignation: ____________\\n3. EXPERIENCE LETTER – STANDARD TEMPLATE\\nDate: ____________\\nTo Whomsoever It May Concern,\\nThis is to certify that Mr./Ms. [Employee Full Name], Employee ID [Employee ID], was employed with (COMPANY NAME) from [Date of Joining] to [Last Working Day].\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"915\",\n        \"_score\": 0.39728185534477234,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"CONFIDENTIAL – Submitted directly to HR\\n\\nSECTION 1: EMPLOYEE INFORMATION\\n\\n Full Name: ____________________    Employee ID: ______________\\n Department: ____________________    Manager: __________________\\n Current Desk: ____________________    Floor: __________________\\n Date of Request: ____________________\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"964\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3967318832874298,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"6. FEEDBACK THEMES\\nExit interviews should broadly cover: \\n- Role clarity and job expectations \\n- Work environment and culture \\n- Managerial support and leadership \\n- Career growth and learning opportunities \\n- Compensation and benefits (high-level) \\n- Workload, work-life balance, and policies \\n- Reasons for leaving and future plans (optional)\\n7. DATA HANDLING AND CONFIDENTIALITY\\nExit interview data to be stored securely by HR\\nAccess limited to authorized HR and leadership\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"926\",\n        \"_score\": 0.39482709765434265,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Somewhat supportive\\nNeutral\\nNot very supportive\\nNot at all supportive\\n7. How well do you feel you are able to communicate with your manager and colleagues?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery well\\nSomewhat well\\nNeutral\\nNot very well\\nNot at all well\\n8. How fair do you feel your compensation and benefits are compared to others in your field and with similar experience?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery fair\\nSomewhat fair\\nNeutral\\nNot very fair\\nNot at all fair\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"244\",\n        \"_score\": 0.39302149415016174,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"6. How satisfied are you with the feedback and performance management processes at the company?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n7. How satisfied are you with the work-life balance at ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n8. Do you feel that you have the flexibility to manage your work and personal commitments effectively?\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"71\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3912124037742615,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"[Employee Name] demonstrated professionalism, dedication, and commitment in the discharge of [his/her/their] duties. [He/She/They] maintained good conduct throughout the tenure of employment.\\nWe wish [Employee Name] all the best in [his/her/their] future professional endeavors.\\nFor [Company Name]\\n\\nName: [Authorized Signatory]\\nDesignation: [Title]\\nDate: [Date]\\n\\nCOMPANY VISION, MISSION & VALUES\\n(Corporate Charter & Culture Document)\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"149\",\n        \"_score\": 0.39104047417640686,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"6. How fair do you feel the company's compensation and benefits are compared to others in the industry?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery fair\\nSomewhat fair\\nNeutral\\nNot very fair\\nNot at all fair\\n7. How well do you feel the company communicates with its employees?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery well\\nSomewhat well\\nNeutral\\nNot very well\\nNot at all well\\n8. How satisfied are you with the resources and support provided by the company for your job?\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"927\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3888423442840576,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"9. How safe do you feel in your current job?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery safe\\nSomewhat safe\\nNeutral\\nNot very safe\\nNot at all safe\\n10. How much do you feel your job allows for personal and professional growth?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nA lot\\nSomewhat\\nNeutral\\nNot very much\\nNot at all\\n11. Is there anything else you would like to share about your job satisfaction at ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.? (optional)\\nThe answer should be a multi line text input.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"924\",\n        \"_score\": 0.38827836513519287,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"1. How satisfied are you with your current job overall?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n2. How well do you feel your job aligns with your values and career goals?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery well\\nSomewhat well\\nNeutral\\nNot very well\\nNot at all well\\n3. How well do you feel your job performance is recognised and appreciated by your manager and colleagues?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery well\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"899\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3871404528617859,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Regular check-ins with manager\\nFeedback and support sessions\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"994\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3851138949394226,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Date: ________________\\n\\n Employee Name: ____________________    Employee ID: ______________\\n Position: ____________________        Department: ______________\\n Desk Assignment: ____________________\\n Report Submitted By: ____________________    Title: ______________\\n\\n \\nVIOLATION DETAILS\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"498\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3834349811077118,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Receiving feedback from a superior\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"246\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3823965787887573,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"11. How well do you feel that you are able to collaborate and work effectively with your colleagues and teams?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery well\\nSomewhat well\\nNeutral\\nSomewhat poorly\\nVery poorly\\n12. How satisfied are you with the company's approach to diversity, equity, and inclusion?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"387\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3818371593952179,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"6. Have you personally experienced any incidents of discrimination or harassment in the workplace?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nYes\\nNo\\n7. Have you witnessed any incidents of discrimination or harassment in the workplace?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nYes\\nNo\\n8. In your opinion, what more can be done to promote diversity and inclusion in the workplace?\\nThe answer should be a multi line text input.\\n9. Have you received any diversity and inclusion training at our company?\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"151\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3804253339767456,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"11. Do you have any feedback or comments to add?\\nThe answer should be a multi line text input.\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"readUnits\": 1,\n    \"embedTotalTokens\": 7\n  }\n}"
