[00:26:23.197] Server  LOG     Heloooooooooooooooooo Pinecone Response: "{\n  \"result\": {\n    \"hits\": [\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"1004\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4532128572463989,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Diversity & Inclusion (D&I) Policy\\nDocument ID: ABIS-HR-POL-012\\n5.1 Our Commitment\\nABIS Foods and Proteins Pvt Ltd celebrates diversity. We believe that a workforce representing a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences is key to our success as an MNC.\\n5.2 Equal Opportunity Employment\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"22\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4465749263763428,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"ABIS Foods and Proteins Pvt Ltd (\\\"The Company\\\") recognizes that a flexible work environment can enhance employee well-being and productivity. This policy provides a structured framework for employees to perform their professional duties from locations other than the designated ABIS offices, ensuring that such arrangements do not compromise operational efficiency, food safety standards, or corporate security.\\n2. Eligibility and Scope\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"141\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4193938970565796,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Welcome to ABIS Foods and Proteins Pvt Ltd. By joining us, you have become part of a legacy dedicated to revolutionizing the agribusiness and food processing landscape. This handbook is designed to be your compass, outlining our shared expectations, your rights as an employee, and the cultural fabric that binds our diverse operations—from our high-tech feed plants to our corporate headquarters.\\n1.2 Our Vision and Mission\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"800\",\n        \"_score\": 0.4167819321155548,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"1. Our Foundations: Purpose & Applicability\\nThis Code of Conduct (\\\"the Code\\\") outlines the ethical and professional standards expected of every individual representing ABIS Foods and Proteins Pvt Ltd.\\nApplicability: This Code applies to all employees, directors, officers, consultants, and contract staff of ABIS and its subsidiaries globally.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"737\",\n        \"_score\": 0.40918704867362976,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"2. Scope\\nThis framework applies to all employees of the organization, including permanent, probationary, and contractual employees, unless otherwise specified.\\n\\n3. Definition\\nJob Level / Band: A broad classification that groups roles based on responsibility, impact, and complexity.\\nGrade: A sub-level within a band that differentiates roles based on experience, skills, or scope within the same band.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"528\",\n        \"_score\": 0.40488600730895996,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. healthy eating options (e.g. subsidised fruits and vegetables)\\n8. Is there anything else you would like to share about your wellness at ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.? (optional)\\nThe answer should be a multi line text input.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"736\",\n        \"_score\": 0.39863327145576477,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"REVIEW FREQUENCY: Annual or upon regulatory change\\nAPPROVAL AUTHORITY: Head – Legal / Compliance\\n\\nJOB LEVEL BANDS & GRADES – FRAMEWORK & MAPPING\\n1. Purpose\\nThe purpose of this document is to define the Job Level Bands & Grades framework used by the organization. This framework provides a standardized structure for classifying roles, determining career progression, aligning compensation, and ensuring internal equity across the organization.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"738\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3780023455619812,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"4. Objectives of the Banding Framework\\nEstablish consistency in role classification\\nSupport fair and transparent compensation structures\\nEnable clear career progression paths\\nFacilitate workforce planning and reporting\\nAlign performance expectations with role levels\\n\\n5. Job Level Band Structure (Illustrative)\\n\\n6. Grade Structure Within Bands (Example)\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"947\",\n        \"_score\": 0.36765149235725403,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"4. Registered / Corporate Office\\nCorporate Office Name: ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. – Corporate Office\\nAddress:\\n[Building Name]\\n[Street Name]\\n[City, State, PIN Code]\\n[Country]\\nPhone: +91-XXXXXXXXXX\\nEmail: corporate@company.com\\n\\n5. Regional / Branch Offices (Illustrative)\\n5.1 Head Office – Bengaluru\\nAddress:\\n[Building Name],\\n[Area],\\nBengaluru – [PIN], Karnataka, India\\nPhone: +91-XXXXXXXXXX\\nEmail: blr.office@company.com\\nFunctions Located:\\nTechnology\\nAnalytics\\nCorporate Support\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"242\",\n        \"_score\": 0.36283940076828003,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"1. How satisfied are you with your current role and responsibilities at the company?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n2. How would you rate the overall working environment at ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nExcellent\\nGood\\nFair\\nPoor\\nVery poor\\n3. How satisfied are you with the level of support and resources provided by your manager and colleagues?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"739\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3622228503227234,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"7. Role Mapping Guidelines\\nRoles are mapped to bands and grades based on:\\nScope of responsibilities\\nDecision-making authority\\nSkills and experience required\\nImpact on business outcomes\\nTeam size (if applicable)\\nHR, in consultation with functional leaders, is responsible for final band and grade assignment.\\n\\n8. Band & Grade Mapping – Sample\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"741\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3619133532047272,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"10. Career Progression\\nCareer movement may occur through:\\nGrade progression within the same band (horizontal growth)\\nBand movement to a higher band (vertical growth)\\nProgression is based on performance, capability, role availability, and business needs.\\n\\n11. Governance & Controls\\nAll band/grade assignments and changes must be approved by HR\\nChanges are documented and updated in the HRMS\\nAudit trails are maintained for all role changes\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"1002\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3591162860393524,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"5. Corporate Health Insurance (Non-Statutory)\\nFor employees earning above ₹21,000, who are not covered by ESI, ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. provides a Group Medical Insurance (GMC) policy.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"243\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3554942011833191,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Very satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n4. How satisfied are you with the opportunities for professional development and advancement at ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n5. Do you feel that your current role is aligned with your career goals and aspirations?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nYes\\nNo\\nSomewhat\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"8\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3538568317890167,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Home Search Trip: For Band 3 and above, the Company provides a 3-day, all-expenses-paid trip to the Host Location to view prospective housing and schools.\\nTemporary Accommodation: Upon arrival, the Company provides managed accommodation to allow the employee time to secure a permanent residence. This includes utilities and cleaning services.\\n2.5 Exclusions and Limitations\\nABIS will not reimburse for the following:\\nTransport of more than two (2) personal motor vehicles.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"223\",\n        \"_score\": 0.35207560658454895,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Transport Policy\\n\\nABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.\\n\\nPolicy Effective Date: <DD/MM/YY>\\n \\n \\nNo part of this documentation may be reproduced or transmitted in any form or by any means, electronic or mechanical, including photocopying or recording, for any purpose without express written permission of the CEO of ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.\\n \\n© 2021, ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. All Rights Reserved\\n \\nRevision History\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"433\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3463872969150543,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. is committed to the holistic well-being of our employees. This Employee Wellness Policy reflects our dedication to creating a workplace that supports physical health, mental well-being, work-life balance, and personal growth. We believe that by investing in the wellness of our employees, we are investing in the long-term success and sustainability of our organization.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"171\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3411938548088074,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Level 3 (Grievance Committee): If the employee is dissatisfied with the Level 2 decision, they may appeal to the Grievance Redressal Committee (GRC). The GRC’s decision is final and binding.\\n2.3 Confidentiality and Non-Retaliation\\nAll grievances will be handled with the utmost confidentiality. ABIS guarantees that no employee will be victimized or penalized for raising a legitimate grievance.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"147\",\n        \"_score\": 0.33892929553985596,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"1. How satisfied are you with your current company overall?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n2. How well do you feel ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. values align with your personal values?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery well\\nSomewhat well\\nNeutral\\nNot very well\\nNot at all well\\n3. How well do you feel the company culture supports a positive work environment?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery well\\nSomewhat well\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"73\",\n        \"_score\": 0.33834314346313477,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"2. About the Organization\\nABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. is a professional organization committed to building sustainable value through people, processes, and technology. The organization believes that a strong culture, ethical conduct, and empowered employees are essential to achieving long-term success.\\n\\n3. Vision\\nTo be a trusted and high-performing organization that empowers people, embraces innovation, and delivers sustainable value through integrity, collaboration, and excellence.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"529\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3380965292453766,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Anti-Sexual Harassment (POSH) Policy\\nDocument ID: ABIS-HR-POSH-01\\nScope: All Employees, Interns, Vendors, and Visitors\\n1.1 Statement of Commitment\\nABIS is committed to providing a work environment free from sexual harassment and discrimination. We maintain a Zero Tolerance approach toward any conduct that violates the dignity of our employees. This policy is compliant with the Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace (Prevention, Prohibition and Redressal) Act and global MNC best practices.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"148\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3371657431125641,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Neutral\\nNot very well\\nNot at all well\\n4. How satisfied are you with the opportunities for career advancement within the company?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n5. How supportive is the leadership team in your role and overall within ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery supportive\\nSomewhat supportive\\nNeutral\\nNot very supportive\\nNot at all supportive\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"15\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3331416845321655,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Deductions: PF (Employee share), Professional Tax (PT), TDS (Income Tax), ESIC, and LWF.\\nAttendance Data: Total days in month, paid days, and leave balance.\\nEmployer Details: ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd., Address, and TAN.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"714\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3320569694042206,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Allowance & Reimbursement Rules\\n1. Objective\\nThis policy is to ensure that employees of ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. are fully reimbursed any expenses incurred by them towards official travel or while participating in business deals. The objective is to provide a common guidance for employees across levels as well as to administrators in ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. for conducting a smooth process.\\n2. Scope and Applicability\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"579\",\n        \"_score\": 0.33185529708862305,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Data Privacy and Protection Policy\\nDocument ID: ABIS-DP-003\\nCompliance: India DPDP Act 2023 & GDPR Standards\\n3.1 Data Fiduciary Responsibility\\nAs a \\\"Data Fiduciary,\\\" ABIS is legally responsible for the \\\"Personal Data\\\" it collects from employees, farmers, and distributors.\\nGrounds for Processing: Data is processed only for \\\"Specified Purposes\\\" (Payroll, Benefits, Logistics) or with \\\"Explicit Consent.\\\"\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"1005\",\n        \"_score\": 0.33107176423072815,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"ABIS is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, gender identity, sexual orientation, national origin, age, or disability. All employment decisions—including hiring, promotion, and compensation—are based solely on merit and business needs.\\n5.3 Inclusive Workplace Standards\\nAccessibility: The company is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for employees with physical or neurodivergent disabilities.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"927\",\n        \"_score\": 0.32980841398239136,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"9. How safe do you feel in your current job?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery safe\\nSomewhat safe\\nNeutral\\nNot very safe\\nNot at all safe\\n10. How much do you feel your job allows for personal and professional growth?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nA lot\\nSomewhat\\nNeutral\\nNot very much\\nNot at all\\n11. Is there anything else you would like to share about your job satisfaction at ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.? (optional)\\nThe answer should be a multi line text input.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"1015\",\n        \"_score\": 0.32923567295074463,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Probation and Confirmation Policy\\nDocument ID: ABIS-HR-PRO-001\\nVersion: 2026.1\\nScope: All New Hires and Internally Transferred Employees\\n1.1 Objective and Philosophy\\nThe probation period at ABIS is an \\\"Introductory Trial Period\\\" designed to ensure a mutual fit between the company’s high-performance culture and the individual’s capabilities. For a food and protein multinational, technical competency and adherence to safety/hygiene standards are critical factors in the confirmation decision.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"224\",\n        \"_score\": 0.32513919472694397,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Objective\\nABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. endeavors to constantly provide the best of facilities and benefits to its employees. The Transport policy provides guidelines to employees and the Transport management team with regards to the eligibility and procedures to be followed.\\n\\nScope and Applicability\\nThis Policy is applicable to all regular employees of the organisation.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"709\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3238973319530487,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"ABIS guarantees that an employee returning from parental leave will be reinstated to their original position or an equivalent role with the same pay and benefits. Performance appraisals will be pro-rated to ensure the leave period does not negatively impact the employee’s career trajectory.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"544\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3231792449951172,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"This scheme is applicable to all the Permanent employees on the rolls of theABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. and their family members, effective from [date].\\n \\nDEFINITIONS\\nRegular Employee – means an employee whose name is borne on the rolls of the company including probationers, Management Trainees, Junior Management Trainees, Worker Artisan Trainees, Adhoc staff, Fixed Term Contractual staff.\\nInsured Person – means Person(s) named on the schedule of the policy.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"1046\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3206108808517456,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Break: Employees are entitled to a 60-minute break for lunch/dinner and two 15-minute tea breaks per shift.\\n2.3 Attendance Tracking (MNC Standard)\\nABIS utilizes an automated Attendance Management System (AMS).\\nBiometric/Face-ID: Mandatory for all office and plant-based employees at entry and exit points.\\nGeofencing: Sales and Field staff must \\\"Check-in\\\" via the ABIS Employee App.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"527\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3203122913837433,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Almost Every Day\\nSeveral Times a Week\\nOnce or Twice a Week\\nA Few Times a Month\\nAlmost Never\\n7. ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. offers the following wellness resources and benefits. Please rate the usefulness of each one:\\nThe answer should be a single choice per row:\\nABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. wellness program\\nABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. gym membership discount\\nABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd. mental health resources and support\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"244\",\n        \"_score\": 0.31990116834640503,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"6. How satisfied are you with the feedback and performance management processes at the company?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n7. How satisfied are you with the work-life balance at ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd.?\\nThe answer should be a single choice:\\nVery satisfied\\nSatisfied\\nNeutral\\nDissatisfied\\nVery dissatisfied\\n8. Do you feel that you have the flexibility to manage your work and personal commitments effectively?\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"413\",\n        \"_score\": 0.31921184062957764,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"The purpose of this policy is to establish guidelines and programs that encourage and support employee wellness in all aspects of their lives, including physical health, mental well-being, and work-life balance.\\n \\n1.2 Scope\\nThis policy applies to all employees of ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd., regardless of their position, employment status, or location.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"715\",\n        \"_score\": 0.31530046463012695,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"This policy is applicable across all designations and divisions of ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd..\\nThis policy is owned by <Name of the Person> and reachable  <Contact Number> and <email address> \\n \\n3. Definition/Glossary \\n\\n4. Policy/Process\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"412\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3150893747806549,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Introduction\\nAt ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd., we believe that our employees are our most valuable asset. We are committed to fostering a workplace environment that promotes and supports the overall well-being of our team members. This comprehensive Employee Wellness Policy outlines our dedication to creating a healthy, balanced, and productive work environment.\\n \\n1.1 Purpose\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"536\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3143654763698578,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Your working hours shall be as per the company’s Time and Attendance and Shift policies applicable to your role.\\n5. Compensation and Benefits\\nYour compensation and benefits will be as per the salary structure shared in Annexure A and governed by applicable company policies.\\n6. Probation\\nYou will be on probation for a period of [3/6] months from your date of joining. Your performance and conduct will be reviewed during this period.\\n7. Leave and Holidays\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"146\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3129611313343048,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"Welcome to ABIS Exports India Pvt. Ltd., satisfaction survey! We value your input and appreciate you taking the time to complete this survey. Your feedback is important to us and will be used to help improve the overall experience for all employees. Please take a few minutes to answer the following questions honestly and to the best of your ability. All responses will be kept confidential. Thank you for your participation!\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"_id\": \"175\",\n        \"_score\": 0.3123175799846649,\n        \"fields\": {\n          \"text\": \"4. Whistleblower & Ethics Policy\\nDocument ID: ABIS-ETH-WB-04\\nObjective: To encourage employees to report \\\"unethical behavior\\\" without fear of reprisal.\\n4.1 Protected Disclosures\\nEmployees are encouraged to report (Whistleblow) on:\\nFinancial malpractice or fraud.\\nCorruption, bribery, or kickbacks.\\nBreach of Biosecurity or Food Safety protocols.\\nManipulation of company data or records.\\n4.2 Reporting Channels (MNC Standard)\\nABIS provides multiple secure channels for \\\"Protected Disclosures\\\":\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"readUnits\": 1,\n    \"embedTotalTokens\": 15\n  }\n}"
